stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING: 冻结输入并入队
  PENDING --> RUNNING: capability + claim + lease
  RETRY_WAIT --> RUNNING: 可执行时间到达并重新领取
  PENDING --> PAUSED: 排队时暂停
  RETRY_WAIT --> PAUSED: 等待时暂停
  PAUSED --> PENDING: 继续
  RUNNING --> PAUSING: 暂停意图
  PAUSING --> PAUSED: 保存检查点
  RUNNING --> CANCELLING: 取消意图
  CANCELLING --> CANCELLED: 领域清理与终态提交
  PENDING --> CANCELLED: 取消
  RETRY_WAIT --> CANCELLED: 取消
  PAUSED --> CANCELLED: 取消
  RUNNING --> RETRY_WAIT: 可重试失败或持久等待
  RUNNING --> COMPLETED: 按领域契约完成
  RUNNING --> FAILED: 永久失败或尝试耗尽
  PENDING --> SKIPPED: deadline 或前置条件
  RETRY_WAIT --> SKIPPED: deadline
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  SKIPPED --> [*]
